  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Gambia Threshold Program - Power Project - Investment Support Activity: the Strategic Investments and Consolidating Change activity is the second phase of the Operations Project. It will implement the plan developed in the first phase and will build upon the learning accumulated in the first phase to support ongoing capacity development and change management at he National Water and Electricity Company (NAWEC) while scaling up investments to deliver more reliable electricity, better customer service, and improved financial performance.</narrative>
  </description>
